  <data name="ExpressionReference" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Expression Reference

1. Variables

%tag                - Match all tags in a comic.
%title              - Match title 1 or title 2.
%title1             - Match title 1.
%title2             - Match title 2.
%rating             - Match rating. For example: 100 represents 5 stars, -1 represents no rating.
%completion_state   - Comic completion state (0 - Unread, 1 - Reading, 2 - Completed).
%progress           - reading progress, in percentage. For example: 50 represents 50%.
%page_count         - Total pages.

2. Variable operators

=                   - Equal. For example: %title = "This is a title"
&gt;                   - Greater than. For example: %rating &gt; 3
&gt;=                  - Greater than or equal.
&lt;                   - Less than.
&lt;=                  - Less than or equal.
... IN (...)        - Contained by. For example:
                      %rating in (3, 4, 5) - Match those comics whose ratings are within 3, 4 and 5.
                      %tag.language in (languageA, languageB) - Match those comics whose "language" tag category contains "languageA" or "languageB".
                      (authorA, authorB) in %tag.authors - Match those comics whose "authors" tag category contains both "authorA" and "authorB".
                      apple in %tag - Match those comics which contains tag "apple".

3. Logic operators

AND                 - Logic and. For example: %tag.fruit = apple AND %title = "I have an apple"
OR                  - Logic or. For example: %title1 = "Apple is OK" OR %title2 = "Orange is also OK"
NOT                 - Logic not. For example: NOT %tag = "hide this"

4. Parentheses

By default, operators will be evaluated from left to right. Use (...) to elevate the
priority of included expression. For example:

    %tag.author = abc AND (%tag.language = langA OR NOT %tag.lang = langB)

The evaluation will be performed in the following order:

    1. NOT %tag.lang = langB  ==&gt;  Result1
    2. %tag.language = langA OR Result1  ==&gt;  Result2
    3. %tag.author = abc AND Result2  ==&gt;  Result3
</value>
